        "summary":  "The article examines six critical decisions CIOs must navigate, including balancing foundational IT investments against growth initiatives and reconciling speed with organizational readiness. AI and cybersecurity challenges have intensified these trade-offs, requiring leaders to integrate multiple priorities simultaneously rather than choosing one side exclusively.",
